DESCRIPTION:Sunday Pickin’ at The Bay features The Sand Ole’ Opry with 
 Mike Whitty & Friends on stage from 4 – 8PM. It’s a weekly jam session
  outdoors overlooking the Choctawhatchee Bay. Follow The Bay on Facebook f
